"Apex, where catastrophes are tolerated, ranks everyone by evacuation priority."
"An Avowed's Evac Priority card appears on the interface halfway across the bridge into Apex."
"Minors and non-Avowed wear an Apex lanyard with an emergency button; Priority 1 is first."
"A B-rank Avowed teen rates about Priority 6, behind five categories."
"Evac priority decides who the System teleports first; the Triplanets set it for global events."
"The Triplanets refused to let the High Council choose priorities in events of global consequence."
"During a disaster the System tells people which shelter or skyscraper to go to."
